<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Automate your control" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Automate your control</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Achieve safe, reliable automation and control for your systems. Our user-friendly design simplifies device and software handling to streamline your workflow.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Maintain high availability" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Maintain high availability</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Expect high availability even in extreme environmental conditions. We apply conformal coating to electronic boards to protect them from harsh environments to keep your critical infrastructure operating.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Capture important data" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Capture important data</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Acquire and record power quality data in medium and low voltage networks. This includes automatic reclosing, synchrocheck and circuit-breaker failure protection informed decision-making.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='5eWg3kpYOBSzUYBFh9SdTT' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='5eWg3kpYOBSzUYBFh9SdTT'><is-land on:visible><div id="com