d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Communication%20protocols-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Communication protocols</h3><div id="G_Communication%20protocols-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Employ up to four pluggable communication modules for various redundant protocols. Support IEC 61850-8-1, IEC 60870-5-103, Modbus TCP and PROFINET IO for flexible network integration.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Cybersecurity functions" id="G_Cybersecurity%20functions-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Cybersecurity%20functions-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Cybersecurity%20functions-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Cybersecurity%20functions-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Cybersecurity functions</h3><div id="G_Cybersecurity%20functions-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Cybersecurity functionality includes role-based access control (RBAC), protocolling security-related events and authenticated network access IEEE 802.1X. Securely access the device on a standard browser to see diagnostic data.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/5eWg3kpYOBSzUYBFh9SdTT-en-US.json" page-id="3Criqu5tFRo0WrjDgVqYS1" container="comp-5eWg3kpYOBS